 is required for the enhancer blocking activity of vertebrate insulators</article-title><source>Cell</source><year>1999</year><volume>98</volume><fpage>387</fpage><lpage>396</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10458613</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B23"><label>23</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Farrell</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>West</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name><name><surname>Felsenfeld</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Conserved CTCF insulator elements flank the mouse and human beta-globin loci</article-title><source>Mol. Cell Biol.</source><year>2002</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>3820</fpage><lpage>3831</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11997516</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B24"><label>24</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Edwards</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Mungall</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Matthews</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Ryder</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Gray</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Pask</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Shaw</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Graves</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Rogers</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><collab>SAVOIR consortium</collab><etal/></person-group><article-title>The evolution of the DLK1-DIO3 imprinted domain in mammals</article-title><source>PLoS Biol.</source><year>2008</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>e135</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18532878</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>